# Capture evidence

Existing `GOLDEN_SHOTS` and existing shot sets are the comparison basis for prior evidence. Add new entries. Do not edit existing ones.

`--webgl` captures are fallback-backend evidence. Treat visual scores from them as provisional until confirmed on real WebGPU.

`--enable-unsafe-webgpu` is opt-in and not representative. Leave it off unless investigating that flag itself.
